{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Closed the gap with test_bounded_task_publishes_only_the_declared_paths, which runs the bounded pipeline with an agent that writes one declared and one undeclared file and reads the published tree back out of the bare remote. It fails without the fix with assert ['NOTES.md', 'README.md'] == ['README.md'] and passes with it. Corrected the plan text, added the matching acceptance criterion and the test path to the declared impact, re-reviewed to PASS with zero blocking, and closed both tickets with no override and a completion signature."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789936237917430001,"uuid":"ddbc2bea-ba06-46ed-ad94-c16a602f4408"}